 resolvePointer({ users: [{ name: "Ada" }] }, "/users/0/name"); // "Ada"
 resolvePointer({ "a/b": true }, "/a~1b"); // true
 ```
+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies an [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+and returns a new JSON value without changing the input document. It supports the `add`, `remove`,
+`replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test` operations and throws when a patch is invalid or cannot be
+applied.
+
+```ts
+import { applyPatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+applyPatch({ users: ["Ada"] }, [{ op: "add", path: "/users/-", value: "Grace" }]);
+// { users: ["Ada", "Grace"] }
+```
