+Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch support. Export `applyPatch(document, patch)` from `src/index.ts`.
+It must apply the `add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test` operations, return a new
+JSON value without mutating the input document, and throw when the patch is malformed or an operation
+cannot be applied.
